        "detail_text": "website for NGO\nart directioN\nux lead\nui design\nimage prompting\nWeb Development\ntesting\nSF Care\ncontext & brief/\nDevelop a website focused on helping refugees to get help, and promote the NGO. Key features: add 3x forms including  data upload and in one case automatic ticket creation with details in Favro,  accessible design, provide helpful informations for refugees, multilingual support, donation functionality, detailed service descriptions, and contact information.\nNGO mission\nSunflower Care is a humanitarian organization dedicated to helping vulnerable individuals, particularly the disabled, neurodivergent, and war-injured in Ukraine. They focus on evacuation, offering barrier-free medical transport, housing for those with urgent medical needs, and assisting with transport costs.\nTheir services extend to navigating German healthcare, providing translation services, and delivering humanitarian aid. They emphasize the importance of anti-ableism and call for solidarity with disabled refugees.\ncauses\nblog\ncontact\nvalues\nteam\nSoftware stack\nUtilized Webflow, Cloudflare, Stripe, Python, JavaScript, Zapier, HREFs, and Figma for development, Imagery via DALL·E 3, Midjourney. Copywriting assistance with Chat GPT.\"",
